{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018ysupw22QdcEsQUFoBXvFj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"论文编译完成。12页PDF，198KB，仅剩hyperref的Unicode书签小警告（不影响内容）。\n\n输出文件：`artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T185145/best/paper.pdf`\n\n论文覆盖了全部8个实验：\n1. **Signal Pipeline** — 4信号×3尺度×3基准的AUC矩阵 + Min-K++方向性反转（Cohen's d表）\n2. **Signal Survival Analysis** — 尺度依赖的信号有效性 + Instruct模型对比\n3. **RRF Aggregation** — 消融对比 + FP鲁棒性\n4. **IRT Calibration** — 主结果表（8方法×6指标）、per-benchmark γ_k、MAE分解、γ规格消融\n5. **7B Scale Bridging** — 剂量-响应 + 校准提升\n6. **RL Observational** — RL模型校准 + 特异性检验 + 预期遗憾分析\n7. **72B Observational** — 前沿模型校准\n8. **2-Signal Closed-Weight** — 降级模式对比\n9. **Multi-Family Validation** — Llama跨族γ_k相关性 + 可辨识性边界\n\n所有定量claim均直接取自experiment_data.json，无编造数字。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":61605,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9818628c-91c5-4e2f-b68b-f03dd5fc4239","uuid":"866eac36-75b6-45ad-9d0a-6036c576e754"}
